  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $g(n)$ be maximal such that given any set $A\\subset \\mathbb{R}$ with $\\lvert A\\rvert=n$ there exists some $B\\subseteq A$ of size $\\lvert B\\rvert\\geq g(n)$ such that $b_1+b_2\not\\in A$ for all $b_1\neq b_2\\in B$.\nEstimate $g(n)$.",
